# Theme: iPone 
# based on the iClassic Theme by Humberto Santana (humbertosantana@hotmail.com)
# License: Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/)
# This Theme is copletely base on the wonderful iclassic Theme. I just fixed some alignment issues and tweak the structure of the menu items,
# that the majotiry of them will show inside the statusbar. Sometimes <ERR> is still shown - maybe fixed in future updates
# Version 1.0
# Last Update: March, 03 2026
# First Version: March, 03 2026
#
# FMS File
#
